1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,683
Assalamu alaikum!

2
00:00:01,683 --> 00:00:06,587
Would you like to make ChatGPT a better Islamic companion to you?

3
00:00:06,587 --> 00:00:19,640
Here's a simple setting change you can make to help it do exactly that — backed by real research from iaser.ai, an organization dedicated to making sure AI benefits Muslims.

4
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:28,580
In your browser, go to s.iaser.ai/prompt.

5
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:32,670
Scroll to the prompt, and click Copy prompt.

6
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:40,360
Now open ChatGPT. Open the sidebar, click your account, and choose Personalization.

7
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:51,120
Click into Custom instructions... paste... and save.

8
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:58,920
And that's it. From now on, every new chat starts with the companion prompt.

9
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:08,840
To read the research, and get versions for Claude and Gemini, visit s.iaser.ai/prompt.

